---
import HSection from "../components/HSection.astro";
import Timeline from "../components/Timeline.astro";
---

<HSection title="What to expect" id="event">
	<div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10">
		<Timeline />
		<div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0">
			<h3>Event Structure</h3>
			<p>
				First, you'll arrive and check in. At 9 we reveal the challenge — then
				you've got the rest of the day to build something with your team.
				Mentors are around if you get stuck. We break for lunch at 12:30 and
				dinner at 5:30. At 7 we stop coding and every team demos what they
				built. Prizes, then home by 8:30.
			</p>
			<br>
			<h3>Food</h3>
			<p>Lunch and dinner are provided, plus snacks. All for free.</p>
			<br>
			<h3>Supervision</h3>
			<p>
				Adult supervisors and mentors will be on site for the whole event. If
				you need to leave early or be picked up, let us know at check-in.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</HSection>
